WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.767
Okay!

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:04.000
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.633
A.

00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:05.300
Snow,

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:05.933
B.

00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:06.567
Moth,

00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:07.233
C.

00:00:07.233 --> 00:00:07.867
Beetle,

00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:09.167
or D.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:09.800
Ant?

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.100
Five seconds!

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:17.533
TIME'S UP!

00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:19.267
The answer is...

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:19.700
A,

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.133
snow!

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:20.567
Beetle,

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:21.000
moth,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.200
and ant are all insects.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.800
Snow is a kind of weather,

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.967
so it does not belong.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.567
Here's one,

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:31.200
a picture puzzle!

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.433
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:34.967
A.

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:35.500
Top,

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:36.033
B.

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:36.567
Right,

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:37.100
C.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:37.633
Bottom-left,

00:00:37.633 --> 00:00:38.733
or D.

00:00:38.733 --> 00:00:39.267
Bottom?

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:40.333
Five seconds!

00:00:45.733 --> 00:00:46.800
TIME'S UP!

00:00:47.233 --> 00:00:48.500
The answer is...

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:48.933
D,

00:00:48.933 --> 00:00:49.367
bottom!

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:51.900
The dot moves three spots clockwise

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.033
around the grid each step,

00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:56.600
so the next spot is bottom.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.400
Here's one,

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.333
a number series!

00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:01.000
Five,

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:01.633
six,

00:01:01.633 --> 00:01:02.300
eleven,

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:02.933
seventeen,

00:01:02.933 --> 00:01:03.600
twenty-eight,

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:04.900
and then...

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.833
what comes next?

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:07.500
A.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.133
Forty-five,

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:08.800
B.

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:09.433
Forty-three,

00:01:09.433 --> 00:01:10.100
C.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:10.733
Forty-seven,

00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:12.033
or D.

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:12.667
Forty-six?

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:13.967
Five seconds!

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:20.433
TIME'S UP!

00:01:20.867 --> 00:01:22.500
The answer is...

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:23.033
A,

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:23.600
forty-five!

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.867
Add the two numbers before it:

00:01:26.867 --> 00:01:29.600
twenty-eight plus seventeen is forty-five.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:30.467
So,

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:32.267
are you smart or fart?

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:34.467
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:34.467 --> 00:01:35.533
find your rank!

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:36.367
So,

00:01:36.367 --> 00:01:37.600
how did you do?

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:38.833
Comment your score below,

00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:40.067
and follow for more!
